-- rm.text --
Usage: rex rm <sel> [-force]

Delete a session and its files. Asks first; without a terminal it needs -force.

Flags:
  -force        do not ask (required when stdin is not a terminal)
  -socket path  daemon socket path (default $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/rex.sock, else
                ~/.cache/rex/rex.sock)
  -y            alias for -force
  -yes          alias for -force

Output:
  -o, --output FORMAT  text, txt, md, json, agent
  --agent              one line per record, no color, no prompts
  --no-color           never emit ANSI color

Example:
  rex rm fix-auth -force
