-- resume.text --
Usage: rex resume <sel> [-print]

Respawn an exited session in place, or unmark a running one marked done. -print
prints the full resume id and sends nothing.

Flags:
  -print        print only the full resume id; send nothing
  -socket path  daemon socket path (default $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/rex.sock, else
                ~/.cache/rex/rex.sock)

Output:
  -o, --output FORMAT  text, txt, md, json, agent
  --agent              one line per record, no color, no prompts
  --no-color           never emit ANSI color

Example:
  rex resume fix-auth
